I know Lynn has kept in close contact with you, but I just wanted to reach out to see how things are going with recruiting for the blood drive.&nbsp; I&#39;m not sure where you are with your appointments (I can&#39;t see that information), but even if you are full, please keep encouraging people to come to your drive. Winter is a critical time for blood donations. I know you can do it!&nbsp;<br />
<br />
If there is any help you need from me - questions, last minute ideas for recruiting, instructions on how to use our online scheduling, Stories of Hope, anything at all, please reach out. I am here to help you reach your goal to save lives. Here is a link to a recepient video you can send out to your team to remind them of why we give:<br />
